   "evidence": "Both restart cases (test/review-rounds.test.ts:920-965) kill the run after `reviewResolution.sha` is already persisted. updateRun writes the state before the 'review-resolution-complete' save, and the test asserts `merge` is set. The pending-resolution resume branch (`conflictRound !== undefined` skips mergeForDelivery, then oneRound resumes mid-round) has no restart test. AGENTS.md requires a restart test for each new step's resume path. The request's required restart case (between resolution and findings) is covered, so this is a gap in additional coverage, not a behavioural defect."
